another glass of wine.

00:01:47.089 --> 00:01:49.866
Or your dad could have
been late because of traffic.

00:01:49.866 --> 00:01:51.952
The odds are so insane.

00:01:51.952 --> 00:01:55.761
I'm just so grateful for what
